OL,3,GNEWSAFaslane dry docks and research
OL,4,Aship to be built in UK, says chancellor
OL,5,
OL,6,FOrders for three floating dry docks,
OL,7,Fworth #6bn, to maintain the Royal
OL,8,FNavy's nuclear-powered submarine fleet
OL,9,Fat Faslane will go to a UK-based
OL,10,Fshipbuilder, the chancellor has
OL,11,Fconfirmed.
OL,13,FJohn Healey told the Labour conference
OL,14,Fthe facilities were vital to national
OL,15,Fsecurity and would support domestic
OL,16,Fshipbuilding as part of a "new age of
OL,17,Findustrialisation".
OL,23,APub: 28-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
FL,423,420,260,160,0,100
