OL,3,GNEWSAFaslane dry docks and research
OL,4,Aship to be built in UK, says chancellor
OL,5,
OL,6,FA UK-only bidding competition will
OL,7,Fdecide who builds the floating docks
OL,8,Fbut Navantia UK, which owns sites in
OL,9,FFife and Belfast, is seen as a
OL,10,Ffrontrunner.
OL,12,FHealey has also pledged #115m for
OL,13,Fconstruction in the UK of a new marine
OL,14,Fresearch vessel to replace Cefas
OL,15,FEndeavour, built by the Ferguson
OL,16,Fshipyard on the Clyde more than 20
OL,17,Fyears ago.
OL,23,APub: 28-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
